# Delivery format

At the end of EVERY task, reply to the user in Brazilian Portuguese using exactly these sections, in this order.

## Resumo
What was done, in a few short sentences.

## Arquivos criados e alterados
A list of paths, one line each saying what changed.

## Comandos que você precisa rodar
Any command the user must run (migrations, seeds, installs, restarts). Write "Nenhum" if none.

## Roteiro de testes
A numbered manual test script that covers EVERY feature added or changed in this task. Each step has the action and the expected result. Use concrete example numbers (for instance: previous balance 120, month value 300, expected available balance 420). Include the edge cases from docs/product-vision.md that apply. The user will follow this script by hand.

## Mensagem de commit sugerida
One Conventional Commits message in English covering everything in this task: `type(scope): summary` (types: feat, fix, refactor, docs, chore, style), a blank line, then bullet points of what was added. Do NOT run the commit. The user commits manually.

## Atenção
Deviations from docs/product-vision.md, decisions you made on your own, known limitations and anything you were unsure about. Write "Nada a declarar" if none.